      "changes": [
        "Derive symmetric physical-copy support of the literal good-physical+whole-auxiliary density from the actual excitation of a unit one-copy vector. Reindex the existing product density by the chosen finite-set enumeration, derive identical-copy vector invariance via Equiv.prod_comp, and apply the actual averaging projector. Generic physical A specializes to Q\u00d7(Y\u00d7V), retaining all middle Y coordinates until projection. Arbitrary original u, k including zero, B and zero component; no supplied symmetry/support/product premise. Source07 lines23,103\u2013110,513\u2013517,520\u2013549. No upstream Lean proof text reused."
